        // (https://gcc.gnu.org/onlinedocs/gcc/Extended-Asm.html). Inline
        // assembly cannot be translated to TypeScript: it names host
        // registers/instructions that have no JS-runtime analogue. The
        // translator emits an IIFE that throws at runtime IF the asm
        // path is reached. Translation succeeds, so codebases with
        // `#ifdef`-gated asm + a C fallback (OpenSSL portable+platform-
        // asm splits, libsodium NEON gates, glibc internal optimisations,
